{
  "description": "The proposed works comprise side and rear ground and first floor extensions, including a rear dormer, to provide improved family accommodation. The proposals create additional bedrooms and shower rooms, a master bedroom suite with dressing room and ensuite, and a more open-plan ground floor with improved natural light and connection to the rear garden through large glazed doors. Crittall-style details provide a nod to the heritage of the property, while the front elevation remains traditional and in keeping with the character of the street.",
